<title>UK: UBS prices 250 mln stg November 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>UBS prices 250 mln stg November 2004 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced by lead manager Union Bank of Switzerland has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UNION BANK OF SWITZERLAND (LONDON BRANCH)</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN STG   COUPON     7.375     MATURITY    26.NOV.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.513    PAY DATE   S27.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    99.513    SPREAD	+39 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.2</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.75 PCT 2004 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
